    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok pa Rwot me mony obino bota, kun wacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“An nyeko omaka pi Cion ki twon nyeko mo madwoŋ, an nyeko omaka pire ki twon akemo madwoŋ-gu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco kuman ni, Abidwogo wa i Cion, ci abibedo wa i dye Jerucalem, pienno Jerucalem gibilwoŋo ni gaŋ me agena, got pa Rwot me mony, got maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, Co muti ki mon muti dok gibibedo piny i dye Jerucalem, ki jo muti gibikomo ki tal ma ŋat acel acel omako i ciŋe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo ducu ma i dye Jerucalem bipoŋ ki awobe ki anyira ma gituko i dye yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, Ka ce lokke obedo me aura i nyim jo ma gudoŋ i kare man, myero lokke obed me aura wa i nyima bene? Man lok pa Rwot me mony kikome, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, Nen ba, an abilaro jona ki i lobo ma yo tuŋ wokceŋ ki i lobo ma yo tuŋ potoceŋ bene; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci abikelogi gibibedo wa i dye Jerucalem; gin gibibedo jona ki an bene abibedo Lubaŋa megi, me agena ki muporre.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, “Jiŋ badwu obed matek, wun jo ma i kare man wubedo ka winyo lok ma lunebi gitye ka waco, nia wa i kare ma gicako keto kwede guti me ot pa Rwot me mony, wek gicak gero iye ot mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma con ca yam pe giculo mucara ki dano mo, wa pi lee bene pe giculo, dok bene onoŋo kuc pe tye bot dano mo me kato ki me dwogo, pi lumerok; pien onoŋo amiyo ŋat acel acel mon ki lawote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento i kare man pe doŋ abitimo jo ma gudoŋ-ŋi kit ma yam atimo i kom jo ma con ca, man lok pa Rwot me mony kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An abimiyo kuc romo kabedo ducu, olok binyako nyige, lobo biceko cam, ki polo bene bimiyo toyo luk i kome; abimiyo jo ma gudoŋ-ŋi camo jami magi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wun jo me ot pa Juda ki me ot pa Icrael, yam nyinwu odoko me lacen dano i kin rok ducu; kombeddi doŋ abilarowu, wek wubed lukel gum i kom jo mukene bene. Pe wulwor, wujiŋ badwu obed matek.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, “Kit macalo yam doŋ ayubbe me timowu marac, nia wa i kare ca ma kwarowu gumiyo akemo omaka, akayo iye laka, Rwot me mony ma owaco, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kit meno i kare man bene dok ayubbe me timo Jerucalem maber ki ot pa Juda bene; pe doŋ wulwor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ep 4.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gin ma myero wutim: ŋat man olok lok me ada bot lawote; wuŋol kop me ada i dog gaŋwu, ma kelo kuc i kin dano; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pe myero ŋat mo i kinwu oyub lok marac ki i cwinye i kom ominne; pe wumar kwoŋo kwoŋ me goba, pien lok meno ducu cwinya dag matek, man lok pa Rwot kikome.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
